00:29:09.120 --> 00:29:13.810
- Oh, I think it's gotta be
seeing kids back in school.

00:29:13.810 --> 00:29:16.490
I mean, I think I took it for granted

00:29:16.490 --> 00:29:21.290
going out and visiting
